sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(255,174,59,0.08) You
    participant U as Your wallet
  end
  box rgba(78,72,64,0.22) Bench machine
    participant A as Agent (0xfe3c…0034)
    participant P as Paywall
  end
  box rgba(77,163,255,0.14) Arc + Circle
    participant G as Circle Gateway
    participant USDC as USDC
    participant AL as Allowance
    participant RB as RecipeBook + SplitVault
  end
  U->>A: sign EIP-2612 permit (no gas)
  A->>USDC: permit() · agent pays gas
  A->>USDC: transferFrom you to agent · 0.006 USDC
  A->>AL: draw this job's spend (1 USDC/day)
  A->>P: POST /usdc/craft
  P-->>A: 402 · 0.005 USDC via Circle Gateway
  A->>P: EIP-712 authorization on its Gateway balance
  P->>G: verify + settle
  G-->>P: accepted · transfer id
  Note over G,USDC: Circle settles onchain in batches
  P-->>A: 200 · Blender built it
  alt the recipe already has an author
    A->>RB: 0.001 USDC
    Note over RB: SplitVault · 90% author, 10% platform
  else a new recipe
    U->>A: sign EIP-712 claim (recipe id + address)
    A->>RB: publishFor() · only the attester
  end
  Note over A,USDC: if the job fails, the charge goes back
